<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>兼职 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%85%BC%E8%81%8C/</link><description>Recent content in 兼职 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%85%BC%E8%81%8C/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>校内兼职</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/study/part-time-job-on-campus/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/study/part-time-job-on-campus/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;校内打工（&lt;code&gt;on-campus job&lt;/code&gt;）是留学生最现实的收入来源：&lt;strong&gt;离得近、时间灵活、而且合法&lt;/strong&gt;——持 F-1 签证的学生第一学年只能在校园内工作，每周有工时上限（通常 20 小时／学期内）。所以这类岗位竞争不小，图书馆前台、健身中心、食堂、院系办公室是最常见的几个。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>